    "sensesNotes": "Darkvision 60 ft, Keen Hearing and Smell",
    "tactics": "The pack leader coordinates wolf ### Attacks, using Pack ### Tactics and Coordinated Strike to bring down large prey. It targets spellcasters and archers first, attempting to knock them prone for the pack to tear apart.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Bite [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 8 + Melee Combat 4 vs opponent's defense), Reach: 5 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 10 damage (6 + 4 Str)</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 10 damage, DR halved (round up)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Special: On margin 2+, target must make Fortitude [Easy] save or be knocked Prone.</p>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Pack ### Tactics: When an ally is within 5 feet of the target, subtract 1 from both attack dice. Keen Hearing and Smell: Sound and scent-based Perception checks have Fortune. Coordinated Strike (1/day): As a [Free] action when this wolf hits an enemy, all allied wolves within 5 feet of that enemy can immediately make one bite attack as a reaction.</p>",
